  "brain_first": "“找词链，不只找重复词。”",
  "sort_order": 1037,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "RECOGNISE - How it usually looks",
      "sourcePage": 58,
      "sourceIndex": 1606
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "候选句与前后出现同一主题的不同表达。",
      "sourcePage": 58,
      "sourceIndex": 1607
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "TERM - What the term really means",
      "sourcePage": 58,
      "sourceIndex": 1608
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Lexical cohesion：文章会用同义、上下义、代称",
      "sourcePage": 58,
      "sourceIndex": 1609
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "维持主题。",
      "sourcePage": 58,
      "sourceIndex": 1610
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "THINK - First sentence in your head: “找词链，不只找重复词。”",
      "sourcePage": 58,
      "sourceIndex": 1611
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "WHY - Why this works: 正确句往往与前后共享一个“语义场”。",
      "sourcePage": 58,
      "sourceIndex": 1612
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STEPS - Follow this route",
      "sourcePage": 58,
      "sourceIndex": 1613
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1 圈空前后的核心名词/动词。",
      "sourcePage": 58,
      "sourceIndex": 1614
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "2 在选项找同义词、上位词、代称。",
      "sourcePage": 58,
      "sourceIndex": 1615
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "3 检查是否只是“同词但不同主题”。",
      "sourcePage": 58,
      "sourceIndex": 1616
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "4 优先选择能把前后两个关键词链连接起来的句子。",
      "sourcePage": 58,
      "sourceIndex": 1617
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "✏ 草稿纸上具体写什么： 空格前后各画一条短线；标 pronoun? / contrast? / cause? / example?；两个",
      "sourcePage": 58,
      "sourceIndex": 1618
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "纠结选项写 A/B 再逐条验指代与逻辑。",
      "sourcePage": 58,
      "sourceIndex": 1619
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "IF/THEN - If... then...",
      "sourcePage": 58,
      "sourceIndex": 1620
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· exercise ↔ physical activity ↔ movement",
      "sourcePage": 58,
      "sourceIndex": 1621
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· students ↔ learners ↔ they",
      "sourcePage": 58,
      "sourceIndex": 1622
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· cost ↔ price ↔ expense",
      "sourcePage": 58,
      "sourceIndex": 1623
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STOP - Stop when: 句子同时与上下至少一边形成清晰词链，且逻辑合理。",
      "sourcePage": 58,
      "sourceIndex": 1624
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STUCK - If you are stuck: 两个选项都有关联词时，用代词和逻辑关系做第二轮筛选。",
      "sourcePage": 58,
      "sourceIndex": 1625
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "EXAMPLE - Worked example",
      "sourcePage": 58,
      "sourceIndex": 1626
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "前句谈 screen time，后句谈 devices，候选里“these digital habits”可能形成同义链。",
      "sourcePage": 58,
      "sourceIndex": 1627
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "TRAPS - Common traps",
      "sourcePage": 58,
      "sourceIndex": 1628
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 只要出现同一个词就选。",
      "sourcePage": 58,
      "sourceIndex": 1629
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 忽略同义替换。",
      "sourcePage": 58,
      "sourceIndex": 1630
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "CHECK - Final check",
      "sourcePage": 58,
      "sourceIndex": 1631
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 它连接的是同一主题吗？",
      "sourcePage": 58,
      "sourceIndex": 1632
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 与前后都能接吗？",
      "sourcePage": 59,
      "sourceIndex": 1633
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "🔧 纠错动作： 做完不要只对答案，先给错误归类。错误代码： 7-P 代词指代｜7-L 逻辑关系｜7-T 主题链",
      "sourcePage": 59,
      "sourceIndex": 1634
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "｜7-O 位置不合理｜7-R 内容重复。",
      "sourcePage": 59,
      "sourceIndex": 1635
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "同一种错误连续出现2次 → 在对应代码旁画★，下次做题先检查这一项。",
      "sourcePage": 59,
      "sourceIndex": 1636
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "MEMORY - 30-second memory: 七选五要找“词链”，不是单个同词。",
      "sourcePage": 59,
      "sourceIndex": 1637
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "可选巩固｜5题（查完SOP后再做）",
      "sourcePage": 59,
      "sourceIndex": 1639
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1. 原文 repeated word 一定原词复现吗？",
      "sourcePage": 59,
      "sourceIndex": 1640
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "2. education→learning 属于？",
      "sourcePage": 59,
      "sourceIndex": 1641
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "3. dog→animal 属于？",
      "sourcePage": 59,
      "sourceIndex": 1642
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "4. 主题链作用？",
      "sourcePage": 59,
      "sourceIndex": 1643
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "5. 只有同一个词但逻辑不通能选吗？",
      "sourcePage": 59,
      "sourceIndex": 1644
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "答案速查：1. 不一定，也可能同义词/上位词。；2. 语义词链/近义关联；3. 上下位词复现；4. 保持段落话题连",
      "sourcePage": 59,
      "sourceIndex": 1645
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "续。；5. 不能。",
      "sourcePage": 59,
      "sourceIndex": 1646
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "— G4 本题型到这里。下次卡住直接 Ctrl+F 搜“G4”或题型关键词。—",
      "sourcePage": 59,
      "sourceIndex": 1647
    }
  ],
